homelab-database (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Generic PostgreSQL provisioning/hardening substrate:
    drop-in conf.d/pg_hba.conf.d config only (never edits vendor files
    directly beyond a single idempotent, sentinel-guarded `include_dir`
    activation line), adopt-existing-cluster detection, opt-in nightly
    pg_dump backup.

